event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_00275e29df2da86b006acbb3d8f10087d1b9d435c284165d10","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":107,"text":"Prince Hamlet of Denmark is devastated by his father’s death and his mother Gertrude’s quick marriage to his uncle Claudius, who has taken the throne. When his father’s ghost reveals that Claudius murdered him, Hamlet feigns madness and struggles with doubt, revenge, and moral hesitation while the court descends into manipulation and tragedy. His pursuit of vengeance leads to the deaths of Polonius, Ophelia, Gertrude, Laertes, Claudius, and finally Hamlet himself."}

